        "name": "sun-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/17/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "無論身在何處，\n都能召喚拉帝歐斯或\n拉帝亞斯的笛子。",
